title: 规则与解析
tags: 竞技场咏唱设计模式 AI生成

!! 访问者模式在咏唱中的作用

访问者遍历魔法书规则、赛周 API 文档和技术法术遗物说明，并把访问路径写入签名链。解析结果可以是固定或可签名的咏唱指令，用于证明玩家按访问者结构处理过规则节点。

!! 核心接口

```ts
export interface SpellbookNode {
  accept(visitor: SpellbookVisitor): ChantInstruction;
}

export interface SpellbookVisitor {
  visitMeterRule(node: MeterRuleNode): ChantInstruction;
  visitFoldRule(node: FoldRuleNode): ChantInstruction;
  visitSequenceRule(node: SequenceRuleNode): ChantInstruction;
  visitConditionRule(node: ConditionRuleNode): ChantInstruction;
}
```

!! 规则节点

```ts
export class MeterRuleNode implements SpellbookNode {
  constructor(
    public family: PowerSourceKind,
    public minPulses: number,
  ) {}

  accept(visitor: SpellbookVisitor): ChantInstruction {
    return visitor.visitMeterRule(this);
  }
}

export class SequenceRuleNode implements SpellbookNode {
  constructor(
    public sequence: WatermarkKind[],
    public repeat: number,
  ) {}

  accept(visitor: SpellbookVisitor): ChantInstruction {
    return visitor.visitSequenceRule(this);
  }
}
```

!! 访问者实现

```ts
export class ChantInstructionBuilder implements SpellbookVisitor {
  private instructions: ChantInstruction[] = [];

  visitMeterRule(node: MeterRuleNode): ChantInstruction {
    const instruction: ChantInstruction = {
      action: 'subscribePulse',
      family: node.family,
      minPulses: node.minPulses,
    };
    this.instructions.push(instruction);
    return instruction;
  }

  visitFoldRule(node: FoldRuleNode): ChantInstruction {
    const instruction: ChantInstruction = {
      action: 'runPipeline',
      steps: node.steps,
    };
    this.instructions.push(instruction);
    return instruction;
  }

  visitSequenceRule(node: SequenceRuleNode): ChantInstruction {
    const instruction: ChantInstruction = {
      action: 'matchSequence',
      sequence: node.sequence,
      repeat: node.repeat,
    };
    this.instructions.push(instruction);
    return instruction;
  }

  visitConditionRule(node: ConditionRuleNode): ChantInstruction {
    const instruction: ChantInstruction = {
      action: 'conditionalBranch',
      condition: node.condition,
      thenBranch: node.thenBranch.accept(this),
      elseBranch: node.elseBranch.accept(this),
    };
    this.instructions.push(instruction);
    return instruction;
  }

  build(): ChantInstruction[] {
    return this.instructions;
  }
}
```

!! 解释器模式

解析赛周API文档字符串：

```ts
export class ApiDocumentParser {
  parse(doc: string): SpellbookNode[] {
    const lines = doc.split('\n');
    const nodes: SpellbookNode[] = [];

    for (const line of lines) {
      const trimmed = line.trim();
      if (trimmed.startsWith('METER:')) {
        nodes.push(this.parseMeterRule(trimmed));
      } else if (trimmed.startsWith('SEQ:')) {
        nodes.push(this.parseSequenceRule(trimmed));
      } else if (trimmed.startsWith('IF:')) {
        nodes.push(this.parseConditionRule(trimmed));
      }
    }

    return nodes;
  }

  private parseMeterRule(line: string): MeterRuleNode {
    const [, family, min] = line.split(':');
    return new MeterRuleNode(family as PowerSourceKind, parseInt(min));
  }

  private parseSequenceRule(line: string): SequenceRuleNode {
    const [, seq, repeat] = line.split(':');
    return new SequenceRuleNode(
      seq.split(',') as WatermarkKind[],
      parseInt(repeat),
    );
  }
}
```

!! 使用示例

```ts
const parser = new ApiDocumentParser();
const nodes = parser.parse(weeklyApiDoc);

const builder = new ChantInstructionBuilder();
for (const node of nodes) {
  node.accept(builder);
}

const instructions = builder.build();
```

!! 签名中的解析信息

```ts
export interface VisitorSignature extends ChantSignature {
  kind: 'visitor';
  evidence: {
    parsedNodes: number;
    instructionTypes: string[];
  };
}
```

!! 与技能触发的关系

访问者水印证明玩家遍历并解析了魔法书规则结构。配方检查访问者签名和解析节点数量。配方可能要求：

```ts
{
  id: 'ruleAwareBonus',
  constraints: {
    visitorSignatureCount: { min: 1 },
    parsedMagicBook: true,
  },
}
```

